were patient HRQL over time, measured by the Functional Assessment of Cancer Therapy-General questionnaire,             
physician-patient communication, and clinical management, measured by content analysis of tape-recorded encounters.     
Analysis employed mixed-effects modeling and multiple regression. RESULTS Patients in the intervention and              
