│ and 98 cases in the no-report group were analyzed. Patients were omitted for the following reasons: left without     │
│ being seen (8), mistakenly enrolled (10), or unretrievable medical records (10). Seventy-nine (42%) patients         │
│ received a psychiatric diagnosis from PRIME-MD and 9 (5%) from the physician. The frequencies of physician           │
